think Held two back. glow_mobile_target and glow_riscv_target each read GREEN in 0s by SKIPPING an absent qemu, and whether that green means anything is REDS %460, OPEN and Keaton's word. Gathering them would publish a fleet-wide green for a leg no ship here runs.
think Six joined the choir: glow_connector_seam, glow_jamcue_vectors, glow_repl, glow_skate_gates, nock_glow_mirror, stoa71_glow_import_seam. Members 26 -> 32, cost 2m01s -> 4m47s measured, still the cadence clock.
